<title>USA: Amerihost won't proceed with offer.</title>
<headline>Amerihost won't proceed with offer.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerihost Properties Inc, a developer of AmeriHost Inn hotels, said Friday it has decided not to proceed with a public offering of 1,150,000 shares of its common stock.  </p>
<p>An Amerihost spokesman said the offering was canceled due to market conditions.</p>
<p>At June 30, the company had about 6.8 million average shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
